cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this proof, its compression route, the tooling, or the evidence data, please cite this repository (see also paper/references.bib and paper/main_en.md / paper/main_zh.md)."
title: "A 2,931-Token Machine-Checked Proof of the Classical Zero-Free Region for the Riemann Zeta Function"
abstract: "A complete Lean 4 proof of the classical de la Vallee Poussin zero-free region for zeta(s), compressed from a 21,641-token / 21-file reference formalization to a single 2,931-token file. Official leaderboard results: submissions 96272/96276/96282/96283 carry the public proof-compression curve flag kept=true (best official score 65.1339). The artifact includes proof sources, tooling, official evidence snapshots, full papers in English and Chinese, and an independent case-split proof."
